Experience. Say it with me. Experience!

12
00:01:15.188 --> 00:01:18.905
Contribute. Say it with me. Contribute!

13
00:01:22.469 --> 00:01:33.218
Grammar time! Present participle clauses. Listen. Working abroad, volunteers gain a global perspective.

14
00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:39.836
